description:
Implement a one-hot detector with a parameterizable input width that outputs a HIGH signal when precisely one bit in the input vector is set to HIGH, indicating a "one-hot" encoding. The module checks for specific one-hot patterns across the defined width, and if no bits or more than one bit are set, the output is LOW.
