Design a clock gating cell that outputs a gated clock signal. The output gated_clk will be HIGH only when the input clk is HIGH and the enable signal is also HIGH, effectively allowing the clock signal to pass through only when enabled, which helps in reducing power consumption in digital circuits by disabling the clock to unused sections.
module top_module(
  input clk,
  input enable,
  output gated_clk
);

